message: "If you use this formalization, please cite the versioned software release."
title: "Genuine Zero Uniform Atlas Energy"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Massensini
    given-names: Thiago
license: MIT
version: 0.8.0
date-released: 2026-08-17
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of the exact identity between the native real-camera
  and Genuine zero, the sharp critical cutoff-tail and collective raw-energy
  expansions, and the exact logarithmic first and second cutoff jets generated
  by the factor M^(-s-1). The library also proves a general vanishing-error
  passage from phase coercivity to an eventual lower bound, while keeping
  empirical cutoff-doubling campaigns as discovery provenance rather than
  kernel assumptions.
keywords:
